    "title": "Build a White-Labeled Web App Powered by Claude AI (Anthropic API)",
    "ciphertext": "~022078740154954203780",
    "description": "I'm looking for a developer to build a web application that works exactly like Claude.ai (Anthropic's chat interface), but fully white-labeled under my own branding.\n\nHow it should work:\n- User asks a question in my platform's interface\n- The platform sends the query to Claude via the Anthropic API\n- Claude's response is displayed back to the user inside my platform\n- No visible reference to \"Claude\" or \"Anthropic\" anywhere in the UI - fully white-labeled\n\nCore functionality (matching Claude.ai's experience):\n- Clean chat interface for asking questions and getting answers\n- Persistent chat history per user\n- User accounts / login system\n- File upload support (so users can upload documents/images and ask questions about them, same as Claude.ai)\n- Responsive web design\n\nTech expectations:\n- Integration with the Anthropic API (I will provide the API key)\n- Secure handling of API keys and user data\n- Clean, modern, branded front-end (branding assets/guidelines will be provided)\n\nWhat I need from you:\n- A brief proposal on your intended tech stack\n- Relevant experience with LLM API integrations (Anthropic, OpenAI, or similar) or chat-based SaaS products\n- Rough timeline and cost estimate for the project\n\nBudget: Please quote based on scope described above.",
